#[1] Local-only launchers. Machine-specific .bat shortcuts carrying absolute local paths.
#    This repository is PUBLIC by nature - it is the GitHub profile repo, and its README
#    renders at github.com/edchen1240 - so nothing machine-specific belongs in it.
#    Square brackets are a glob character class, so they MUST be escaped: an unescaped
#    [G] matches a file named "G_..." that has never existed, and the rule then silently
#    protects nothing. Written as a glob so a later rename cannot break it.
\[*\]_*.bat

#[2] OS clutter.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
